---
description: GarageGuru work must go through Jira GG and GitHub, not local markdown
alwaysApply: true
---

GarageGuru delivery is Jira + GitHub.

- Jira project: GG on https://anka.atlassian.net
- Demo story: GG-2 https://anka.atlassian.net/browse/GG-2
- Branch, commit, and PR titles must include the Jira key (`feature/GG-2-booking-cancellation`).
- Read ticket acceptance criteria from Jira before coding.
- Use `docs/06-integrations/repo-inventory.md` to decide which of Node, React, and the Flutter apps change.
- Open a pull request. Do not push to main. Do not deploy production.
- Local files under `docs/02-jira/` are snapshots only.
